\
**Terminal Chamber:**\
- **Location:** Carved into cliff system beneath Ruined Castle formation\
- **Elevation:** ~520 meters above sea level (120m below castle formation, 220m above valley floor)\
- **Size:** Larger than Junction Alpha\'97this is the primary research facility\
- **Access:** Pod arrival 
