## **7. Operational Notes**\
\
### **Daily Usage:**\
- On-demand dispatch only\
- Pod system: 10-15 transits typical day\
- Rail system: 2-3 freight runs typical day\
- Night: Minimal (emergency/urgent access only)\
- Peak usage: Mornings and evenings (staff travel)\
\
### **Who Uses It:**\
- Senior researchers (Sarah, Johnny, Chip)\
- Technical staff who work at Ruined Castle\
- Security personnel\
- Eloise (via private elevator when she chooses)\
- The Sages (travel method unclear\'97they simply... appear)\
\
### **Who Doesn't Know About It:**\
- Most Shakti Enterprises employees\
- Government officials\
- Approximately 99% of the population\
- Alexander (Eloise hasn't decided if he needs to know)\
\
### **Emergency Protocols:**\
- Pod malfunction: Switch to rail system evacuation\
- Railway failure: Emergency climbing access to maintenance tunnels\
- Complete system failure: Staff shelter in place (facilities designed for extended isolation)\
- Catastrophic structural failure: Staff are encouraged to have updated wills\
\
### **The Unspoken Understanding:**\
Everyone who works "Down Below" knows they're part of something either revolutionary or catastrophically dangerous, possibly both. The Traverse itself is daily reminder: Eloise Shakti builds things that shouldn't exist, and somehow makes them work.\
